 "note": "A linear 6% push over 150 f (5 s) so stills, plates and held frames keep moving. Keep the clip no longer than 150 f: once the push stops, a full-frame plate held above 100% is reported by lint as cropped at rest. Curve baked as keys (linear joins) - see the skill's ai/patterns/corporate-brand.md.",
 "anchor": "in",
 "frames": 150,
 "tracks": [
  {
   "property": "size",
   "keys": [
    {
     "at": 0.0,
     "value": 1.0,
     "easing": "Linear"
    },
    {
     "at": 1.0,
     "value": 1.06,
     "easing": "Linear"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}